msgid "Take a 20-question exam on the IBM Training site to test your quantum information skills and receive a badge through Credly."
msgstr "Ikuti ujian 20 pertanyaan di situs IBM Training untuk menguji keterampilan informasi kuantummu dan terima lencana melalui Credly."

